              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibiila diima suniini inni waan utubaani balbala fullo Waaro Woyyuma ta AABBO Waaqaa ira ejaanjufi waan mesa fakaatatiifi gingilcha isiitiifi miha isaa ch'ufale mid'aase. ",
